 521++78E3              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
 522++78E3              ; Load fixed-origin X86IO/X86ALU overlays from TR-DOS through the shared
 523++78E3              ; ABI 1.0 fixed-profile IMAGE service.
 524++78E3              ;
 525++78E3              ; p126_neogs_open_file reads sector 0 to C000h and leaves the remaining
 526++78E3              ; sector cursor in the shared TR-DOS state. Move the first sector backwards
 527++78E3              ; into the IMAGE fragment data area at C01Ch (overlap-safe LDDR), then read
 528++78E3              ; subsequent sectors directly into the following 256-byte slots. This avoids
 529++78E3              ; a second staging buffer and preserves the 18-byte frame header.
 530++78E3              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
 531++78E3              ; Shared module loader. IN: HL=TR-DOS 8-byte name, A=IMAGE kind,
